Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
This is probably the closest match to your requirements.
Usage	Allowed?
Personal use	✅ Yes
Studying and learning	✅ Yes
Sharing lectures for free	✅ Yes, with attribution
Modifying or adapting materials	✅ Yes, with attribution
Non-commercial teaching	✅ Yes
Commercial use	❌ Requires separate permission
Selling your lectures	❌ Requires separate permission
Using your lectures in paid courses	⚠️ Generally requires permission


Important: Attribution is required even for non-commercial sharing and adaptations, not just commercial uses.
